{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"text\": \"这个人对他很重要，他仍想被选择、彼此靠近，不能如愿时还是会疼。\",\n      \"key\": \"想被选择\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再等到自己不怕失望，才肯继续喜欢。\",\n      \"key\": \"不怕失望\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"text\": \"安心靠近、真心付出、独自珍藏、尽情欢喜，都曾让他真切快乐，让他舍不得把喜欢丢下。\",\n      \"key\": \"真切快乐\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道对方未必也想靠近，不愿让对方觉得非回应不可，勉强来的亲近也不是他想要的。\",\n      \"key\": \"非回应不可\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"text\": \"当初怕对方看出自己有多在意，他把心收住，如今仍没说出口，却不因对方未必回应就觉得自己不该喜欢。\",\n      \"key\": \"不该喜欢\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把两次讲无风险的爱法合成一个具体条件：他不必等到不怕失望才继续喜欢。S13已经经历过两种做法都不能保证结果，这里不再重复解释局限，而是写出局限怎样改变了他对继续喜欢的要求。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\", \"R71\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把仍想被选择与不能如愿时会疼放在一条里，保留愿望、对方心意未知和未来的代价，去掉重复宣布渴望仍在。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R67\", \"R72\", \"R73\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-2\", \"S14-4\", \"S14-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分重组\",\n      \"why\": \"把不把期待变成对方义务写成怕对方被迫回应的具体顾虑；把不因对方的选择否定自己的真心放到结尾，并让继续喜欢成为实际的内心选择，不再堆成伦理宣言。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R70\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-1\", \"S14-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留安心靠近、真心付出、独自珍藏和尽情欢喜这四种真实快乐，并写出它们为何让他舍不得放下喜欢。对方有多重要落在当下仍想被选择的渴望里，不再另加抽象的没白费总结。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5a5fd92b-d354-486f-88ad-d809c0e83e78", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T115508413657Z", "elapsed_seconds": 902.531, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T12:10:10.951512+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c942ac5932311b10164b26d6f3c200dad3523555c0c8239d0d308759e122e3ab", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T115508413657Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5bd871ad4bca7f045cb2dec0a5fd20145eb2c237995e890dde66a4bb5cca3f67"}}}
